  "details": "There are some g𝖗𝖔ups that are abusing bo𝖙s to spam invi𝖙𝖊 users to their group. I𝖓 my humble opinion, this is a bad use case for a bot. If I am interested in joining the group I will look at the group description, banner, rules, and events to determine if I want to join. \n\nI would like VRChat to suppress group invites of groups who spam invites. I would also like the ability to turn off group invites showing in my notifications. \n\nOf course there are ways to report these groups for abusing the invite system, but I think VRChat can do more to help mitigate them.",
